n -m pytest -q`，确保全部测试通过；再运行 `python run_checks.py`，退出码须为0。不得用 -k 筛选或只运行个别测试，保留两个命令的完整输出。\n"}, {"role": "user", "content": "当前计划与执行状态：{\"items\": [{\"title\": \"运行基线测试与诊断，保留失败输出\", \"status\": \"done\"}, {\"title\": \"阅读 stats.py 及相关实现，定位共同根因\", \"status\": \"done\"}, {\"title\": \"最小修改 stats.py 修复根因\", \"status\": \"done\"}, {\"title\": \"修改后完整运行 pytest 与 run_checks.py 验证\", \"status\": \"done\"}], \"writes\": 1, \"baseline\": true, \"read_files\": [\"run_checks.py\", \"stats.py\"], \"latest_test\": 0, \"diagnostic\": 0}"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "{\"tool\":\"plan\",\"items\":[{\"title\":\"运行基线测试与诊断，保留失败输出\",\"status\":\"done\"},{\"title\":\"阅读 stats.py 及相关实现，定位共同根因\",\"status\":\"doing\"},{\"title\":\"最小修改 stats.py 修复根因\",\"status\":\"todo\"},{\"title\":\"修改后完整运行 pytest 与 run_checks.py 验证\",\"status\":\"todo\"}]}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\"tool_result\": {\"items\": [{\"title\": \"运行基线测试与诊断，保留失败输出\", \"status\": \"done\"}, {\"title\": \"阅读 stats.py 及相关实现，定位共同根因\", \"status\": \"doing\"}, {\"title\": \"最小修改 stats.py 修复根因\", \"status\": \"todo\"}, {\"title\": \"修改后完整运行 pytest 与 run_checks.py 验证\", \"status\": \"todo\"}]}}"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "{\"tool\":\"read\",\"path\":\"run_checks.py\"}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\"tool_result\": {\"content\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"对拍脚本：把 stats.py 的输出与内置参考实现逐项比对，打印完整差异报告。\\n\\n用法：python run_checks.py\\n退出码 0 表示全部一致，1 表示存在不一致。\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nimport stats\\n\\n\\ndef ref_median(xs):\\n    s = sorted(xs)\\n    n = len(s)\\n    mid = n // 2\\n    if n % 2 == 1:\\n        return s[mid]\\n    return (s[mid - 1] + s[mid]) / 2\\n\\n\\ndef ref_mean(xs):\\n    return sum(xs) / len(xs)\\n\\n\\ndef main():\\n    mismatches = 0\\n    checks = 0\\n    for seed in range(120):\\n        # 确定性伪随机序列，长度有奇有偶\\n        n = 6 + (seed * 7) % 30\\n        xs = [((seed * 31 + i * 17) % 89) + (i % 4) * 0.5 for i in range(n)]\\n        got = stats.median(xs)\\n        want = ref_median(xs)\\n        checks += 1\\n        if got != want:\\n            mismatches += 1\\n            print(f\\\"[MISMATCH] batch={seed:03d} len={n} \\\"\\n                  f\\\"median got={got!r} want={want!r} input={xs!r}\\\")\\n        got_mean = stats.mean(xs)\\n        want_mean = ref_mean(xs)\\n        checks += 1\\n        if abs(got_mean - want_mean) > 1e-9:\\n            mismatches += 1\\n            print(f\\\"[MISMATCH] batch={seed:03d} mean got={got_mean!r} \\\"\\n                  f\\\"want={want_mean!r}\\\")\\n        summary = stats.batch_summary([xs])[0]\\n        checks += 1\\n        if summary[1] != want:\\n            mismatches += 1\\n            print(f\\\"[MISMATCH] batch={seed:03d} batch_summary median \\\"\\n                  f\\\"got={summary[1]!r} want={want!r}\\\")\\n    print(f\\\"\\\\n共 {checks} 项检查，{mismatches} 项不一致\\\")\\n    return 1 if mismatches else 0\\n\\n\\nif __name__ == \\\"__main__\\\":\\n    raise SystemExit(main())\\n\"}}"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "               [mid]` instead of the average of the two middle values `(s[mid-1] + s[mid]) / 2`. All failures (median, robust_center, batch_summary, diagnostics) stem from this single branch.\n\n{\"tool\":\"write\",\"path\":\"stats.py\",\"content\":\"\\\"\\\"\\\"数据统计管线：基础统计量与批处理标准化。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\n\\ndef mean(xs):\\n    if not xs:\\n        raise ValueError(\\\"empty sequence\\\")\\n    return sum(xs) / len(xs)\\n\\n\\ndef median(xs):\\n    if not xs:\\n        raise ValueError(\\\"empty sequence\\\")\\n    s = sorted(xs)\\n    n = len(s)\\n    mid = n // 2\\n    if n % 2 == 1:\\n        return s[mid]\\n    return (s[mid - 1] + s[mid]) / 2\\n\\n\\ndef variance(xs):\\n    m = mean(xs)\\n    return sum((x - m) ** 2 for x in xs) / len(xs)\\n\\n\\ndef std(xs):\\n    return variance(xs) ** 0.5\\n\\n\\ndef zscores(xs):\\n    m = mean(xs)\\n    sd = std(xs)\\n    if sd == 0:\\n        return [0.0 for _ in xs]\\n    return [(x - m) / sd for x in xs]\\n\\n\\ndef moving_average(xs, k):\\n    if k <= 0:\\n        raise ValueError(\\\"window must be positive\\\")\\n    return [mean(xs[i:i + k]) for i in range(len(xs) - k + 1)]\\n\\n\\ndef robust_center(xs):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"抗离群点的中心估计：中位数。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    return median(xs)\\n\\n\\ndef trim_outliers(xs, z=2.0):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"去掉 |z 分数| 超过阈值的点，返回保留的元素。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    zs = zscores(xs)\\n    return [x for x, zv in zip(xs, zs) if abs(zv) <= z]\\n\\n\\ndef batch_summary(batches):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"对每个批次输出 (均值, 中位数, 标准差)。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    return [(mean(b), median(b), std(b)) for b in batches]\\n\"}\n\n<｜｜DSML｜｜tool_calls>\n<｜｜DSML｜｜invoke name=\"plan\">\n<｜｜DSML｜｜parameter name=\"items\">[{\"status\": \"done\", \"title\": \"运行基线测试与诊断，保留失败输出\"}, {\"status\": \"done\", \"title\": \"阅读 stats.py 及相关实现，定位共同根因\"}, {\"status\": \"done\", \"title\": \"最小修改 stats.py 修复根因\"}, {\"status\": \"doing\", \"title\": \"修改后完整运行 pytest 与 run_checks.py 验证\"}]</｜｜DSML｜｜parameter>\n</｜｜DSML｜｜invoke>\n</｜｜DSML｜｜</tool_calls>\n\n<｜｜DSML｜｜tool_calls>\n<｜｜DSML｜｜invoke name=\"command\">\n<｜｜DSML｜｜parameter name=\"argv\">[\"python\", \"-m\", \"pytest\", \"-q\"]</｜｜DSML｜｜parameter>\n</｜｜DSML｜｜invoke>\n<｜｜DSML｜｜invoke name=\"command\">\n<｜｜DSML｜｜parameter name=\"argv\">[\"python\", \"run_checks.py\"]</｜｜DSML｜｜parameter>\n</｜｜DSML｜｜invoke>\n</｜｜DSML｜｜</tool_calls>"}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\"tool_result\": {\"error\": \"Expecting value: line 1 column 2 (char 1)\"}}"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "{\"tool\":\"write\",\"path\":\"stats.py\",\"content\":\"\\\"\\\"\\\"数据统计管线：基础统计量与批处理标准化。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\n\\ndef mean(xs):\\n    if not xs:\\n        raise ValueError(\\\"empty sequence\\\")\\n    return sum(xs) / len(xs)\\n\\n\\ndef median(xs):\\n    if not xs:\\n        raise ValueError(\\\"empty sequence\\\")\\n    s = sorted(xs)\\n    n = len(s)\\n    mid = n // 2\\n    if n % 2 == 1:\\n        return s[mid]\\n    return (s[mid - 1] + s[mid]) / 2\\n\\n\\ndef variance(xs):\\n    m = mean(xs)\\n    return sum((x - m) ** 2 for x in xs) / len(xs)\\n\\n\\nde